 elect 30 fellows based on their potential to make significant contribution
 s to American society\, culture\, and their chosen fields\, across discipl
 ines including the arts.\n\nOrganisation: The Paul & Daisy Soros Fellowshi
 ps for New Americans\nLocation: USA. For immigrants and children of immigr
 ants pursuing graduate or professional study at US institutions.\nAward: U
 p to USD 90\,000 over two years (stipend and tuition support) toward gradu
